Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:01.60,0:00:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人世謂緣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:05.10,0:00:07.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繫結的絲線糾結纏繞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:07.40,0:00:09.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脆弱可悲的彼岸花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:10.00,0:00:13.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在憤怒 悲傷 淚水中度日
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:14.50,0:00:16.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,午夜零點的帷幕彼方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:17.20,0:00:20.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難消之恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:23.80,0:00:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}いつか{\K80}光{\K40}に向{\K40}か{\K60}う　{\K60\K30}逆{\K90}さまの{\K60}蝶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:29.00,0:00:33.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}君{\K20}と{\K40}髪{\K50}を{\K30}切{\K60}る　{\K30\K80}鏡{\K40}の{\K100}中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:34.20,0:00:39.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}授業{\K50}中{\K60}の{\K80}廊下　{\K80\K40}響{\K40}く{\K100}足音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:39.90,0:00:45.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}絶{\K20}えず{\K30}雨{\K40}の{\K60}音{\K60}が　{\K20\K40}つい{\K50}て{\K40\K40}くる{\K50}よ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:45.30,0:00:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}感{\K30}じ{\K45}る{\K45}まま{\K30}の{\K70\K60}形{\K40}は{\K60}眩{\K60}しい
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:50.50,0:00:55.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}甘{\K30}い{\K50}花{\K50}にな{\K80}る　{\K20\K30}毒{\K10}の{\K10}実{\K10}に{\K60}も{\K60}なる
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:55.80,0:01:00.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}今日{\K60}も{\K120}雨　{\K40\K40}あの{\K120}日と今{\K40}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:01.00,0:01:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}空{\K30}と{\K30}空{\K30}で{\K30}つ{\K60}なぎ{\K80}た{\K30}い{\K60}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:05.30,0:01:08.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:08.30,0:01:10.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:11.10,0:01:15.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:16.20,0:01:18.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:18.70,0:01:21.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K160}ひとつの{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:21.60,0:01:26.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:27.20,0:01:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K20}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:29.60,0:01:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:32.40,0:01:37.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:37.90,0:01:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K10}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:40.40,0:01:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K140}それぞれの{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:43.20,0:01:48.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:54.70,0:01:55.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,騙人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:55.80,0:01:57.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒騙人啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:57.20,0:01:59.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個 看看這個圖
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:00.50,0:02:01.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:02.90,0:02:06.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,翔 愛你啊 翔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:06.60,0:02:08.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本人又聽不到
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:08.40,0:02:10.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在跟店員聊天時聽說的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:10.50,0:02:11.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像是那裏的常客
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:12.80,0:02:15.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那下次大家一起去吧 即使逃課也要去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:16.10,0:02:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詩織呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:19.20,0:02:20.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,當然了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:20.50,0:02:25.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個 聽說其他的偶像也經常去那裏的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:25.50,0:02:28.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在一些愛好者中很有名啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:30.50,0:02:32.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼用那種眼神看我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:32.70,0:02:35.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要做朋友的話找別人不就好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:35.90,0:02:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我說 你們修學旅行的小組成員決定了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:40.40,0:02:41.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一起就好啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:41.90,0:02:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一起就好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:45.90,0:02:46.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能原諒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:47.20,0:02:48.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,絕對不能原諒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:55.70,0:02:57.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,學校怎麼樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:57.20,0:02:58.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好學習了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:58.40,0:03:00.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那當然是努力了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:00.50,0:03:03.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好不容易如願插班的呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:03.60,0:03:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吧 南
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:06.40,0:03:09.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說起來 詩織最近好像沒怎麼來玩嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:10.30,0:03:11.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:11.60,0:03:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比較忙吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:59.30,0:04:02.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近信越來越多了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:02.40,0:04:03.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:04.00,0:04:10.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是沒有能商量的人呢 朋友之類的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:12.50,0:04:13.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:14.00,0:04:19.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}朋友
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:21.80,0:04:22.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:23.10,0:04:24.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你呼喚我的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:24.60,0:04:25.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是閻魔愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:26.40,0:04:29.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女嗎 來了嗎 多謝
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:33.50,0:04:34.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,請收下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:41.40,0:04:44.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你若真的要消除怨恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:45.30,0:04:47.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將那紅線解開即可
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:48.00,0:04:49.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解開繩線
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:49.40,0:04:52.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就和我正式締結了契約
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:53.00,0:04:56.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怨恨的人將立刻墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:57.10,0:04:57.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:59.40,0:05:01.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還是考慮清楚吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:02.90,0:05:03.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,考慮過了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:04.40,0:05:07.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想來想去 就只有這樣做了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:08.00,0:05:09.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨恨若已消除
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:09.70,0:05:12.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自身亦將付出代價
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:13.60,0:05:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害人終害己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:16.00,0:05:17.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,締結契約後
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:17.60,0:05:20.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的靈魂亦將墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:21.70,0:05:23.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過那是你死之後的事了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:25.60,0:05:26.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:29.60,0:05:31.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣活着也是地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:36.70,0:05:39.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,與其在這裏解開還不如在她面前解開的好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:41.20,0:05:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被打入地獄的時候
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:43.40,0:05:44.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她會是怎樣的表情呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:45.60,0:05:46.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真值得一看啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:51.20,0:05:52.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早上好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:53.60,0:05:57.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個美容師好帥氣 我真想去啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:03.10,0:06:05.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這笑容真噁心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:07.20,0:06:11.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詩織 今天放學後就要和你告別了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:13.10,0:06:14.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到現在雖然有很多經歷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:16.00,0:06:18.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂喂 插班生什麼樣啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:18.70,0:06:19.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來了來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:23.10,0:06:27.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Hi 到這裏讀中學嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:28.30,0:06:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是初中部的赤坂詩織 請多關照
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:32.70,0:06:34.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個 我是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:34.30,0:06:36.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四月開始就是同學了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:39.30,0:06:41.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是澀谷南
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:45.60,0:06:47.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不錯吧 這個樂隊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:48.10,0:06:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是沒聽過這個樂隊啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:51.20,0:06:55.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是在這裏 但是在那邊很受歡迎哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:55.80,0:06:57.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,歌詞也很棒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:00.20,0:07:02.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還是英語的啊 看不明白
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:02.80,0:07:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次翻譯給你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:08.70,0:07:11.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還把你當做好朋友
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:12.20,0:07:13.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到發生那件事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:18.60,0:07:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先走了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:30.70,0:07:33.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 詩織 弄得這麼晚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:33.60,0:07:34.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得救了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:35.90,0:07:40.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他科目就算了 只有英語很擔心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:41.50,0:07:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:42.90,0:07:44.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思 南
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:44.40,0:07:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天不能一起回去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:48.40,0:07:50.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 是嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:50.90,0:07:54.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赤坂學的英語是叫皇后英語吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:55.80,0:07:59.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赤坂家很大吧 真期待啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:59.60,0:08:00.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒有那樣的事啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:00.94,0:08:02.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(444,278)\fs16}正在查詢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:02.45,0:08:03.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(444,278)\fs16}沒有保存的郵件
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:06.70,0:08:08.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(444,278)\fs16}沒有保存的郵件
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:14.95,0:08:17.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(432,190)\fs18}怎麼不回消息啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:21.30,0:08:24.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女生體育課在體育館集合
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:37.70,0:08:40.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,體育課啊　熱得難受
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:41.00,0:08:42.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還在看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:43.50,0:08:47.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就這麼想讓折磨我嗎 就像那時
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:49.00,0:08:50.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這不是跟蹤嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:51.10,0:08:52.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:52.20,0:08:52.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:53.00,0:08:57.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,隔30分鐘發郵件 絕對是跟蹤狂沒錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:58.50,0:09:00.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你認爲該怎麼辦好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:00.30,0:09:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和老師說吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:02.20,0:09:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:03.90,0:09:04.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就這麼辦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:05.90,0:09:07.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嗎 知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:08.30,0:09:10.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老師去和澀谷說說讓她別這樣做了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:11.30,0:09:12.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜託了 老師
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:15.00,0:09:16.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告辭了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:20.20,0:09:22.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 下週日
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:38.00,0:09:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 詩織
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:40.60,0:09:42.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些話要和你說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:42.50,0:09:44.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 我無話可說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:45.40,0:09:46.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幹什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:46.70,0:09:49.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詩織你誤會了 我並不是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:50.20,0:09:51.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放開啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:55.10,0:09:56.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詩織
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:56.50,0:09:57.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒事吧 詩織
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:58.00,0:09:59.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 有點疼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:01.80,0:10:04.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蠟跡可是洗不掉的啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:04.20,0:10:06.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詩織 我真的是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:06.80,0:10:08.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想對赤坂做什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:09.00,0:10:11.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 你就是那個跟蹤狂嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:12.10,0:10:13.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由我來懲辦她吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:13.90,0:10:15.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是什麼跟蹤狂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:18.30,0:10:21.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詩織 至少你要相信
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:21.70,0:10:25.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要說了 不要再折磨我了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:32.30,0:10:35.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家再無視我也沒關係
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:39.00,0:10:40.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已經習慣了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:42.10,0:10:45.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詩織 我會讓你受到懲罰的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:47.60,0:10:49.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以不要再這樣了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:54.40,0:10:56.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要用那樣的眼神看我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:56.60,0:10:57.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詩織
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:59.50,0:11:00.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒事吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:02.10,0:11:03.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去保健室吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:06.90,0:11:08.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常感謝
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:23.30,0:11:26.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,說起來 那是什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:48.20,0:11:49.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:49.90,0:11:50.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼啊這是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:51.20,0:11:53.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,準備用這個咒殺我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:53.80,0:11:55.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,撞到手指也是因爲詛咒的關係
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:56.40,0:11:57.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白癡啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:01.40,0:12:04.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你這樣想的話 那我也
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:09.90,0:12:11.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒有 沒有 沒有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:14.80,0:12:17.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不快點去的話 要賣完了哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:20.20,0:12:21.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到哪裏去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:37.70,0:12:38.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:39.40,0:12:41.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個 話說回來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:41.60,0:12:43.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咖啡要續嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:44.40,0:12:45.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不用了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:48.50,0:12:51.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個 能在收據上簽字嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:52.00,0:12:55.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再加一句這事情決不外傳
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:58.50,0:13:00.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 只是以防萬一
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:03.10,0:13:05.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也好 沒關係
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:06.00,0:13:09.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不過我認爲這東西不會派上用場的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:09.20,0:13:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜託了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:55.00,0:13:55.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:56.10,0:13:58.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒 沒什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:00.30,0:14:01.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帳就你付了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:12.00,0:14:13.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟丟了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:24.20,0:14:27.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟蹤狂 跟蹤狂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:32.00,0:14:35.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,該詛咒的應該是南 你纔對
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:46.10,0:14:49.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀呀 災難啊 輪入道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:50.20,0:14:54.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 即使是丑時來 用的卻不是五寸釘
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:54.80,0:14:55.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是普通的釘子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:56.50,0:14:59.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs18}丑時咒還應該在人偶中加上被詛咒者的頭髮
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:56.50,0:14:59.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近的孩子連用法都不知道啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:00.00,0:15:02.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,夠可憐的啊 幫你拿掉吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:02.40,0:15:03.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:06.30,0:15:07.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:07.90,0:15:09.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(255,471)}怎麼了 小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:10.30,0:15:11.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(255,471)}不用回收了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:13.10,0:15:14.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(255,471)}暫時這樣放着吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:18.80,0:15:20.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過南那孩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:21.00,0:15:23.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黑人偶被拿走了可怎麼辦呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:34.00,0:15:35.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,南感冒了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:36.50,0:15:38.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所今天請假不去上學了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:41.10,0:15:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是神的指示吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:45.10,0:15:48.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阻止我復仇的指示吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:55.60,0:15:57.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詛咒的效果
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:57.50,0:15:59.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個草人太厲害了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:01.50,0:16:04.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 應該不會就這樣死了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:04.50,0:16:07.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不用擔心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:08.10,0:16:10.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因爲先下手的是她啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:12.60,0:16:13.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日程就這樣安排
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:14.30,0:16:16.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全體人員分成三人一組
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:20.50,0:16:23.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀 詩織 爲什麼到這裏來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:23.20,0:16:24.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們已經滿員了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:25.40,0:16:27.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是之前不是說了一起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:29.00,0:16:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒說嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:30.40,0:16:33.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們突然決定和上野同學一起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:33.90,0:16:34.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:46.90,0:16:48.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想見我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:48.70,0:16:50.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎…怎麼回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:54.40,0:17:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前的事真對不起 所以還是做朋友吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:04.70,0:17:06.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詩織
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:06.80,0:17:08.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我纔對不起你啊 詩織
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:09.00,0:17:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到底是怎麼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:10.30,0:17:12.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然想把詩織送到地獄去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:13.00,0:17:15.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 對不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:39.10,0:17:39.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詩織
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:49.60,0:17:50.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家好過分啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:51.50,0:17:53.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一有事就不當我是朋友
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:54.90,0:17:56.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被騙了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:57.00,0:17:58.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我被騙了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:59.20,0:18:00.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:00.70,0:18:01.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,南
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:03.00,0:18:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真正的朋友只有南你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:07.70,0:18:09.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原諒之前的我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:11.50,0:18:14.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再做回朋友吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:21.60,0:18:22.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:23.20,0:18:25.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的 真的好嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:26.80,0:18:27.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:28.80,0:18:29.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這個是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:31.70,0:18:33.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼會在詩織那 這個
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:35.10,0:18:37.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 南 這個是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:39.60,0:18:42.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒關係 已經沒關係了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:42.90,0:18:43.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,南
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:47.40,0:18:48.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詩織
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:50.30,0:18:52.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀哎呀 和好了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:53.50,0:18:55.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以外的結局啊 小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:56.80,0:18:58.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不看到最後嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:02.40,0:19:05.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,討厭喜劇的結局吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:07.10,0:19:08.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用了這個吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:08.80,0:19:09.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:10.20,0:19:12.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,詛咒班裏的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:14.20,0:19:17.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是這個稻草人 不是普通的稻草人啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:19.00,0:19:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:20.20,0:19:21.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是用釘子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:22.10,0:19:25.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把這裏的紅線拉開 這樣對方就會下地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:27.40,0:19:29.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 那個
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:29.40,0:19:31.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什麼啊 那麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:31.30,0:19:32.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:32.30,0:19:33.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:33.50,0:19:36.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不是我解開的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:38.80,0:19:41.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 給你 解開吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:43.00,0:19:43.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:44.00,0:19:45.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解開啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:45.40,0:19:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:46.90,0:19:48.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解開啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:49.60,0:19:51.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解開啊解開
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:51.80,0:19:53.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到了 是那個女孩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:54.00,0:19:55.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,解開啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:56.50,0:19:57.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:57.70,0:20:01.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣的話這 我死後也會去地獄的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:02.50,0:20:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以 不行…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:04.50,0:20:05.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:05.40,0:20:06.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:07.30,0:20:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以 所以 不行…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:20.00,0:20:23.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 我們是朋友吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:24.60,0:20:25.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:27.80,0:20:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真正的朋友啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:32.40,0:20:33.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是真正的朋友的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:34.60,0:20:36.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,會幫我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:40.70,0:20:43.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還是說不是真正的朋友
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:46.90,0:20:48.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朋…朋友
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:49.80,0:20:53.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 那麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:04.20,0:21:09.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 詩織 我們是真正的朋友嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:15.70,0:21:18.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨 恨 已 聞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:24.40,0:21:26.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:27.20,0:21:28.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,南
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:28.30,0:21:31.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,南 南 哪裏啊 哪裏啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:42.90,0:21:46.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是 不是我的錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:47.40,0:21:48.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你的錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:49.00,0:21:49.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,騙人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:51.10,0:21:54.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是你所希望的憎恨的世界
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:56.10,0:21:56.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:57.70,0:22:00.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能吧 也許是這樣吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:03.10,0:22:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是詩織也有錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:05.50,0:22:07.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,認爲是朋友就爲所欲爲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:11.20,0:22:13.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也考慮下我的心情啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:24.50,0:22:27.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這位 和你一起的女孩哪裏去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:29.30,0:22:30.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,應該在地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:34.10,0:22:35.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是沒關係
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:36.60,0:22:38.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,總有一天我也會去的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:46.70,0:22:50.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在那邊我們也做朋友吧 詩織
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:55.60,0:22:59.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,君之怨恨 願爲消之
